ups.google.com/d/msg/vim_dev/HSLOZYvPtbM/4lLHzso6qXcJ\u003e そろそろあのパッチも眠らせてあげたいと思う。 さようなら。if_mruby。 思い出をありがとう。","thumb_url":"http://quyo.hatelabo.jp/images/og-image.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Quyo | つづろう、モノの思い出","service_icon":"http://quyo.hatelabo.jp/images/favicon.ico","thumb_width":1200,"thumb_height":630,"from_url":"http://quyo.hatelabo.jp/items/549241c433643700025f0000","original_url":"http://quyo.hatelabo.jp/items/549241c433643700025f0000"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XFSL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c89b0bd-e6e0-47c5-99bf-e2cfb4ac3bb3","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"最近mrubyを触っていて、文字列操作が得意なmrubyで書けたらいいなあとは思っていました。","ts":"1617331521.168000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UTBe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbe223b4-7e64-46c1-9562-dc2d9cb2172e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それくらいならVim scriptでやってしまいそう","ts":"1617331317.167400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UCFEJF487"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rjkne"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a015d283-6aa3-4263-85fc-564fdad60854","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003c#C01N4L5362D|tech-denops\u003e","ts":"1617331003.167100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lFSZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee0c3760-3c1b-4f43-9ff6-4f78e3169879","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"もしくはdenops","ts":"1617330974.167000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=GYN5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4350c57e-62f9-4330-8390-1e7f39fa6fb9","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"こんにちは！\n\u003chttps://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/\u003e\nConventional Commitsというコミットメッセージの規約っぽいものを見つけました。これはVimプラグインのいい題材だなと思ったのですが、プラグインは全然触ったことなくて、今ならどの言語で書くのが良さそうなんでしょうか？\n普段使いはNeovimですがVimでも動いてほしいので、Vim scriptでしょうか。","ts":"1617330944.166800","thread_ts":"1617330944.166800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Conventional Commits","id":1,"title":"Conventional Commits","title_link":"https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/","text":"A specification for adding human and machine readable meaning to commit messages","blocks":null,"service_name":"conventionalcommits.org","from_url":"https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/","original_url":"https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EzVnM"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"\u003c@UCFEJF487\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1617330808.165200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"4c9e319e-1cda-4495-ba08-3ddfef2ffd1a","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"気がついていなかった！ こんな解決策でいいんですかねw (根本的にどうがんばっても一周では再現できないレイアウトなのかな？)","ts":"1617353656.190500","thread_ts":"1617351935.190300","parent_user_id":"U7986PPFH","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1r5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20e5be33-9e5e-44d4-8248-269dd523e4fb","type":"message","user":"UCFEJF487","text":"基本的にやりたいことは、\n• コミットメッセージをいい感じにハイライトする\n• 規約に違反しているコミットメッセージを保存できなくする\n程度しかないです。","ts":"1617331196.167200","thread_ts":"1617330944.166800","parent_user_id":"UCFEJF487","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OjDOb"}]}]
